Z||000000||1FST2M6||03-21-2001||02:02 PM||||well back in january when Tigger and I hooked up for lunch I picked up an out side intake scoop from him. thinking if it doens't help at least it looks shiney and different... well i've had it painted and i installed some stainless mesh inside it... <P>i put the car on the dyno and no obvious HP increase.. BUT we have fans and a manometer and an wind velocity meter from summit racing.. best best we can muster is a 35mph wind on the front of the car to attempt to emulate the cars movement.. anywho.. at 35mph.. i'll scan these dyno sheets.. i gained 1.13hp and .98lbft. (71* 76%humitidy  at 30.08(b/p)) the HP numbers arent killer but the looks sure are!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstintake1.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstintake2.JPG"> <P><BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig1fst.jpg">   <BR>if i only had a pencil thin mustache||||reg||1
